values ('fq_star_002', 'We Hunt the Hunters', 'story', 'D', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'DUNE_OUTSKIRTS', 'Sergeant Korg''s briefing is blunt in the way that experienced soldiers are blunt when they respect the troops they are briefing: the Dune Stalkers hunt Legion caravans because no one has made hunting Legion caravans painful enough to stop. (Location: Dune Outskirts, Sergeant Korg) The Legion''s code of honor has a specific clause for this: when an enemy hunts you, you hunt them in return, with greater force and complete commitment. A Legionnaire does not become prey. The Dune Stalkers learn this today.', '{"npc_id": "npc_drill_sergeant_korg", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "DUNE_OUTSKIRTS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 1, "reputation_required": 5, "required_quests": ["fq_star_001"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "DUNE_STALKER", "count": 5, "description": "Hunt Dune Stalkers."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "sand_claw", "count": 3, "description": "Collect sand claw (x3). [Item: Sand Claw]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 55, "currency": 35, "crd": 0, "rep": 35, "items": [{"item_id": "animal_fang", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_003', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 1)
