values ('fq_star_003', 'Fight on Any Terrain', 'story', 'D', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'DUNE_OUTSKIRTS', 'Centurion Valka''s first lesson to every new Legion recruit, delivered with the flat certainty of someone who has never been comfortable anywhere and has made that into a weapon: ''A Legionnaire fights on any terrain, against any enemy, in any condition.'' The Scorched Scarabs burrowing beneath Legion outposts represent terrain that fights back. (Location: Dune Outskirts, Sergeant Korg) Good. That is the kind of terrain the Legion makes into an advantage. Dig them out. Fight them in their own element. The lesson is not about Scarabs.', '{"npc_id": "npc_drill_sergeant_korg", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "DUNE_OUTSKIRTS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 2, "reputation_required": 10, "required_quests": ["fq_star_002"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SCORCHED_SCARAB", "count": 6, "description": "Purge Scorched Scarabs."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "scarab_shell", "count": 3, "description": "Collect scarab shell (x3). [Item: Scarab Shell]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 70, "currency": 40, "crd": 0, "rep": 40, "items": [{"item_id": "rust_chitin", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_004', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 2)
