values ('fq_star_004', 'Relentless Is the Legionnaire''s Nature', 'story', 'D', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'DUNE_OUTSKIRTS', 'Sand Runners are fast creatures of the desert — built by evolution to be faster than anything that chases them. (Location: Dune Outskirts, General Kaelen) Grand Justiciar Aurelius chose this quarry deliberately for the fourth trial: the Legion is not trained to be the fastest thing in any environment. The Legion is trained to be the most relentless. Swift prey outlasts the burst-speed predator. It does not outlast the predator that never stops. Run them down. This is not speed training. This is will training.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "DUNE_OUTSKIRTS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 3, "reputation_required": 15, "required_quests": ["fq_star_003"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SAND_RUNNER", "count": 5, "description": "Run down Sand Runners."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "sand_claw", "count": 3, "description": "Collect sand claw (x3). [Item: Sand Claw]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 80, "currency": 50, "crd": 0, "rep": 50, "items": [{"item_id": "con_nutrient_ration", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_005', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 3)
