values ('fq_star_006', 'The Badlands Are Lawless Until We Arrive', 'story', 'D', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'SCORCHED_BADLANDS', 'The Scorched Badlands are everything the Legion was warned about Xylos: harsh, contested, filled with creatures that have evolved aggression as a survival trait in a world saturated with corrupted aethel. Grand Justiciar Aurelius does not send the Legion into such terrain reluctantly. The badlands are exactly the environment Legion soldiers were hardened for. Establish the forward command post. The badlands are lawless until the Legion arrives. After the Legion arrives, they are not. Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "SCORCHED_BADLANDS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 5, "reputation_required": 25, "required_quests": ["fq_star_005"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "SCORCHED_BADLANDS", "count": 1, "description": "Enter the Scorched Badlands."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "ember_fang", "count": 1, "description": "Collect ember fang (x1). [Item: Ember Fang]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 100, "currency": 60, "crd": 0, "rep": 60, "items": [{"item_id": "con_nutrient_ration", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_007', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 5)
