values ('fq_star_008', 'Poison the Poisoners', 'story', 'D', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'SCORCHED_BADLANDS', 'Dune Scorpions have poisoned three Legion water reservoirs, killing a supply crew and triggering an emergency ration restriction across the Scorched Badlands forward camp. Scout Jace''s assessment is terse and accurate: these are not random attacks. The Scorpions are territorial and the Legion has established its camp in the center of their territorial zone. The Legion''s response to territorial disputes is historically simple. Exterminate the competition. Recover the stingers for antivenom production. Waste nothing.', '{"npc_id": "npc_dune_scout", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "SCORCHED_BADLANDS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 7, "reputation_required": 35, "required_quests": ["fq_star_007"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "DUNE_SCORPION", "count": 6, "description": "Exterminate Scorpions. [Dune Scorpion]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "scorpion_stinger", "count": 3, "description": "Collect scorpion stinger (x3). [Item: Scorpion Stinger]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 180, "currency": 100, "crd": 0, "rep": 100, "items": [{"item_id": "scorpion_stinger", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_009', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 7)
