values ('fq_star_010', 'There Is No Territory We Cannot Take', 'story', 'D', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'SCORCHED_BADLANDS', 'A Scrapfield Enforcer has occupied the Badlands'' central canyon, disrupting Legion patrol routes and attacking any soldier who enters its claimed zone. (Location: Scorched Badlands, General Kaelen) Grand Justiciar Aurelius reviews the reconnaissance report and issues a single order: ''Challenge it.'' The Legion does not route around territorial claims. The Legion does not negotiate access to ground it has decided belongs to the Legion. Challenge the Enforcer''s authority with the Brute escorts cleared first. Claim the canyon. There is no territory the Legion cannot take.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "SCORCHED_BADLANDS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 9, "reputation_required": 45, "required_quests": ["fq_star_009"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SCRAPFIELD_ENFORCER", "count": 1, "description": "Defeat the Enforcer. [Scrapfield Enforcer]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "BADLAND_BRUTE", "count": 2, "description": "Clear Brute escorts. [Badland Brute]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 300, "currency": 180, "crd": 0, "rep": 180, "items": [{"item_id": "rusted_plate", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_011', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 9)
