values ('fq_star_018', 'The Warpath''s Commander Must Fall', 'story', 'C', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'MESA_WARPATH', 'A War Machine Sentinel Commander has activated deep in the Warpath''s archaeological layer — a pre-Severance automated command unit that has been running battle protocols for centuries against enemies that no longer exist. (Location: Mesa Warpath, General Kaelen) It is now running those protocols against the Legion, and its targeting is advanced enough to make it a genuine threat rather than an obstacle. Grand Justiciar Aurelius studies the Sentinel''s battle patterns with professional respect before issuing the order: ''Destroy it. Learn from its tactics first. Then destroy it.''', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "MESA_WARPATH"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 17, "reputation_required": 85, "required_quests": ["fq_star_017"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "RESONANCE_ECHO", "count": 1, "description": "Destroy the Resonance Echo."}, {"type": "kill", "target": "WARPATH_CHAMPION", "count": 2, "description": "Clear Champion guards. [Warpath Champion]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 800, "currency": 450, "crd": 0, "rep": 450, "items": [{"item_id": "entropy_core", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_019', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 17)
