values ('fq_star_025', 'What the Canyon Holds Cannot Be Taken', 'story', 'B', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'FORGE_CANYON_DEPTHS', 'The Titan Proto-Cores deep in the Forge Canyon Depths are the most concentrated examples of Aethelgardian manufacturing technology remaining on Xylos — forged from Prima Materia in the canyon''s natural furnaces before the Severance. The Iron Hegemony wanted them. The Concordium''s engineers have theoretical interest in them. The Starforged Legion has a simpler claim: they are in the Legion''s canyon, and the Legion takes what is in its territory. Assault the Proto-Core positions. Take what belongs to the strongest. Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "FORGE_CANYON_DEPTHS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 24, "reputation_required": 140, "required_quests": ["fq_star_024"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "TITAN_PROTO_CORE", "count": 2, "description": "Destroy Proto Cores. [Titan Proto Core]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "titan_core", "count": 1, "description": "Collect titan core (x1). [Item: Titan Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 1800, "currency": 900, "crd": 270, "rep": 560, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 10}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_026', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 24)
