values ('fq_star_027', 'Rift Stalkers in Legion Territory', 'story', 'B', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'BORDER_SKIRMISH_RING', 'Aethel Rift Stalkers have established a presence in the Border Skirmish Ring sectors the Legion has claimed — void-touched predators that recognize no territorial boundary the Legion has planted. Grand Justiciar Aurelius does not distinguish between hostile factions and hostile creatures in his operational doctrine: anything in Legion territory that has not been authorized to be there is a target. Clear the Rift Stalkers from the claimed sectors. Show the border zone what Legion territorial enforcement looks like. Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "BORDER_SKIRMISH_RING"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 26, "reputation_required": 160, "required_quests": ["fq_star_026"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_RIFT_STALKER", "count": 6, "description": "Patrol. [Aethel Rift Stalker]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 1900, "currency": 950, "crd": 285, "rep": 590, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 10}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_028', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 26)
