values ('fq_star_030', 'The Second Trial of the Starforged', 'story', 'B', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'FORTRESS_KAELEN', 'Centurion Valka speaks the words that the Legion''s code reserves for soldiers who have proven themselves in the hardest terrain on Xylos: ''You have earned the Second Trial.'' The Resonance Echo from the Warpath must be confronted again — it has grown stronger, drawn by the canyon''s electromagnetic activity. (Location: Fortress Kaelen, Centurion Valka) The Shard Pulse Tyrant of the Hegemony''s Forge represents the hardest combat challenge the Forge Canyon offers. These are the Second Trial''s two tests. Pass both. Grand Justiciar Aurelius will conduct the Ascension ceremony personally.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_class_trainer", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "FORTRESS_KAELEN"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 29, "reputation_required": 190, "required_quests": ["fq_star_029"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "interact", "target": "npc_legion_class_trainer", "count": 1, "description": "Report to Centurion Valka. (Centurion Valka at Forge Canyon Depths Combat Arena)"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "RESONANCE_ECHO", "count": 1, "description": "Prove strength. [Resonance Echo]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "TITAN_PROTO_CORE", "count": 1, "description": "Prove endurance. [Titan Proto Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2050, "currency": 1025, "crd": 307, "rep": 635, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 10}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_031', true, 'on_quest_complete', 29, 'fq_star_029', 'quest_legion.json', 29)
