values ('fq_star_034', 'The Expanse Does Not Host Corruption', 'story', 'A', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'Corrupted Behemoths — once the great natural guardians of the Cradle Expanse, twisted beyond recognition by the Concordium''s extraction operations — now threaten the Legion''s operational positions in the Expanse with the particular danger of creatures whose strength was never meant to be turned hostile. Grand Justiciar Aurelius hunts them with the grim pragmatism of someone who understands the tragedy without letting it stop the mission: ''They cannot be saved. They can be ended. End them cleanly.'' Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 33, "reputation_required": 275, "required_quests": ["fq_star_033"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_CORRUPTED_BEHEMOTH", "count": 2, "description": "Hunt. [Aethel Corrupted Behemoth]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "crystal_core", "count": 1, "description": "Collect crystal core (x1). [Item: Crystal Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2250, "currency": 1125, "crd": 546, "rep": 695, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 25}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_035', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 33)
