values ('fq_star_037', 'The Drake Learns What Judgment Means', 'story', 'A', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'The Ashen Drake has returned to the Cradle Expanse following its earlier encounter with the Legion. Grand Justiciar Aurelius reviews the intelligence with what might be approval: ''It came back. That is either courage or stupidity.'' In the Legion''s code, courage deserves respect. The Drake''s return, regardless of the reason, is an opportunity to prove that the Legion''s first engagement was not anomalous. Defeat the Drake a second time. Collect the heart. The Legion''s judgment of the Expanse''s apex creature is final and consistent. Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 36, "reputation_required": 350, "required_quests": ["fq_star_036"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "ASHEN_DRAKE", "count": 1, "description": "Execute judgment. [Ashen Drake]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "ancient_scale", "count": 1, "description": "Collect ancient scale (x1). [Item: Ancient Scale]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2400, "currency": 1200, "crd": 582, "rep": 740, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 25}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_038', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 36)
