values ('fq_star_042', 'Void Reavers Die the Same as Everything Else', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Void Reavers — entities born from the Chasm''s accumulated void energy — present a unique tactical challenge in that standard engagement doctrines do not fully apply to creatures with no physical mass in the conventional sense. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) Centurion Valka''s tactical brief covers this with characteristic efficiency: ''They die the same as everything else when you hit them hard enough. Find the hard enough. Document it. Apply it six times.'' The Legion builds operational doctrine from every engagement. Void Reavers are today''s data set.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 41, "reputation_required": 500, "required_quests": ["fq_star_041"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "VOID_REAVER", "count": 6, "description": "Purge. [Void Reaver]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_VOID_CHANNELER", "count": 4, "description": "Purge. [Aethel Void Channeler]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2650, "currency": 1325, "crd": 642, "rep": 815, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_043', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 41)
