values ('fq_star_043', 'The Abyssal Is Another Problem With the Same Solution', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Aethel Abyssal Reavers — the void''s most developed entities in the Chasm''s mid-levels — are more organized than the basic Void Reavers above, capable of coordinating ambushes in the Chasm''s narrow access passages. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) Grand Justiciar Aurelius reviewed the ambush tactics the Reavers have been using against other factions'' incursion teams and made a single note: ''Predictable after the second encounter.'' The Legion''s tactical advantage over the void is that the void''s patterns are learnable. Learn them. Then break them. Then eliminate the ambush force.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 42, "reputation_required": 550, "required_quests": ["fq_star_042"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 5, "description": "Hunt. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "raw_aethel_fragment", "count": 2, "description": "Collect raw aethel fragment (x2). [Item: Raw Aethel Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2700, "currency": 1350, "crd": 654, "rep": 830, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_044', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 42)
