values ('fq_star_045', 'What Fragments Souls Faces the Legion', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Soul Fragmenters — entities that devour the soul-echoes trapped in the Chasm since the Great Severance — are, in the Legion''s operational assessment, primarily a threat-elimination target. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) Centurion Valka does not engage with the theological implications of what Soul Fragmenters are doing to the Severance''s trapped souls. The Legion''s code does not require theological engagement — it requires tactical effectiveness. Two Soul Fragmenters are in the Chasm''s designated elimination zone. The solution is the same as it always is in the Legion''s code: strength, application, completion.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 44, "reputation_required": 650, "required_quests": ["fq_star_044"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SOUL_FRAGMENTER", "count": 2, "description": "Break. [Soul Fragmenter]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2800, "currency": 1400, "crd": 678, "rep": 860, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_046', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 44)
