values ('fq_star_046', 'The Wraith That Loops Time Is a Target', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Chrono Wraiths operate in temporal fractures that the Chasm''s structure creates — points where the Great Severance''s temporal damage has created loops that feed the Wraith indefinitely. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) Grand Justiciar Aurelius''s tactical brief acknowledges the unusual nature of the target without elaborating on it: ''It exists in a time loop. Break the loop by destroying the anchor. The anchor is the Wraith. This is not philosophically complicated.'' Two Chrono Wraiths, two temporal loops dissolved. The Legion clears time the same way it clears terrain.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 45, "reputation_required": 700, "required_quests": ["fq_star_045"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CHRONO_WRAITH", "count": 2, "description": "Eliminate. [Chrono Wraith]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 1, "description": "Collect monster material (x1). [Item: Monster Material]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2850, "currency": 1425, "crd": 690, "rep": 875, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_047', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 45)
