values ('fq_star_047', 'Mountains Move When the Legion Commands', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'A Gigantic Jotunn occupies the Chasm passage that the Legion''s advance requires. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) Grand Justiciar Aurelius''s battle brief is one of the shortest on record: ''The mountain is in our way. Move it.'' The Jotunn''s geological nature and ancient claim to the deep stone is not a factor in Legion operational planning. What is a factor: it is in Legion territory, it is blocking a Legion advance, and it will be removed by Legion force or by understanding that the Legion does not stop. The Jotunn will understand one of these things.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 46, "reputation_required": 750, "required_quests": ["fq_star_046"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GIGANTIC_JOTUNN", "count": 1, "description": "Conquer. [Gigantic Jotunn]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2900, "currency": 1450, "crd": 702, "rep": 890, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_048', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 46)
