values ('fq_star_050', 'Execute the Exorcism Protocol', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Soul Fragmenters and a Void Stalker have established a combined operation in the Chasm''s shadow zone — the Stalker coordinating the Fragmenters'' harvest with tactical precision that Grand Justiciar Aurelius finds operationally interesting and strategically intolerable. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) ''They are running a coordinated operation inside Legion-designated territory,'' he says, with the tone of someone who considers this personally offensive. Execute the Exorcism Protocol: the Stalker eliminated first, the Fragmenters cleared, the operation disbanded completely.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 50, "reputation_required": 900, "required_quests": ["fq_star_049"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SOUL_FRAGMENTER", "count": 3, "description": "Exorcise. [Soul Fragmenter]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "VOID_STALKER", "count": 1, "description": "Exorcise. [Void Stalker]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3100, "currency": 1550, "crd": 750, "rep": 950, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_051', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 49)
