values ('fq_star_052', 'The Stalker That Hides in the Shard''s Blind Spot', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'A Void Stalker has taken up residence in the Chasm''s electromagnetic blind spot — the zone where the Shard''s electromagnetic field bends around a void singularity, creating a region that standard detection cannot reach. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) Grand Justiciar Aurelius is not deterred by detection limitations. The Legion''s scouts found it through physical reconnaissance rather than electronic detection. ''It hides from instruments. It cannot hide from soldiers.'' Enter the blind spot. Execute the Stalker. The Chasm has no zones the Legion cannot reach.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 52, "reputation_required": 1000, "required_quests": ["fq_star_051"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "VOID_STALKER", "count": 1, "description": "Execute. [Void Stalker]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3200, "currency": 1600, "crd": 774, "rep": 980, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_053', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 51)
