values ('fq_star_053', 'Time Loops Are Terrain Features to Be Cleared', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Three Chrono Wraiths in the Chasm''s deep zone have created overlapping temporal fractures that are functionally preventing the Legion from establishing a stable forward position in the area — every time the position is established, the temporal loops reset the zone''s state. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) Centurion Valka''s engineering assessment translates this into Legion operational language: ''The terrain resets because the Wraiths reset it. Eliminate the Wraiths. The terrain will stop resetting.'' Banish all three. Establish the position.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 53, "reputation_required": 1050, "required_quests": ["fq_star_052"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CHRONO_WRAITH", "count": 3, "description": "Close breach. [Chrono Wraith]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 1, "description": "Collect monster material (x1). [Item: Monster Material]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3250, "currency": 1625, "crd": 786, "rep": 995, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_054', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 52)
