values ('fq_star_054', 'The Purification at the Deepest Level', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'The deepest accessible level of the Void Echo Chasm contains the highest concentration of Abyssal Reavers and Void Reavers that the Legion has encountered in any single engagement. Grand Justiciar Aurelius''s battle brief is longer than usual, because the tactical complexity is higher than usual: multiple target types, coordinated void behavior, narrow engagement corridors. The brief ends with the standard conclusion: ''Eliminate all. Document the engagement. Apply the lessons forward.'' Ten Reavers, six Void Reavers. This is the Legion''s deepest engagement yet. Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 54, "reputation_required": 1100, "required_quests": ["fq_star_053"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 10, "description": "Assault. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "VOID_REAVER", "count": 6, "description": "Clear. [Void Reaver]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3300, "currency": 1650, "crd": 798, "rep": 1010, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_055', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 53)
