values ('fq_star_055', 'The Last Geological Obstacle', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Three Gigantic Jotunns have settled in the Chasm''s lower levels, creating seismic interference that is disrupting the Legion''s tunnel engineering for the deep zone forward post. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) The Legion''s engineering team has been waiting three days for clearance. Grand Justiciar Aurelius does not believe in waiting: ''Geological obstacles are obstacles. Obstacles are cleared.'' All three Jotunns must be guided from the interference zone. The engineering team has a four-hour window once the zone is clear. Do not waste the window.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 55, "reputation_required": 1150, "required_quests": ["fq_star_054"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GIGANTIC_JOTUNN", "count": 3, "description": "Break. [Gigantic Jotunn]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3350, "currency": 1675, "crd": 810, "rep": 1025, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_056', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 54)
