values ('fq_star_056', 'The Tyrant Battery Must Be Silenced', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Crystal Tyrants — crystal entities that have claimed control of the Chasm''s concentrated aethel nodes — are using the nodes'' energy output as a weapon system, projecting energy attacks that have been taking significant casualties from Legion forward patrols. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) Centurion Valka calls this ''a tyrant battery'' and treats it as an artillery problem: identify the battery positions, eliminate the firing units, suppress the remaining fire, advance. Two Crystal Tyrants, two positions eliminated. The Chasm''s artillery belongs to the Legion now.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 56, "reputation_required": 1200, "required_quests": ["fq_star_055"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CRYSTAL_TYRANT", "count": 2, "description": "Silence. [Crystal Tyrant]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 1, "description": "Collect monster material (x1). [Item: Monster Material]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3400, "currency": 1700, "crd": 822, "rep": 1040, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_057', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 55)
