values ('fq_star_057', 'Harbinger''s Vanguard Cannot Hold the Chasm', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'The Harbinger is sending its vanguard force into the Chasm — Abyssal Reavers acting as its advance elements, with a Chrono Wraith maintaining a temporal anchor that will hold the passage open for the Harbinger itself when it arrives. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) Grand Justiciar Aurelius reads this deployment with the assessment of an experienced general facing an organized enemy: ''It is preparing a beachhead. Deny the beachhead.'' Destroy the vanguard. Destroy the temporal anchor. When the Harbinger arrives, it will arrive into Legion-controlled territory with no advance preparation intact.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 57, "reputation_required": 1250, "required_quests": ["fq_star_056"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 6, "description": "Clear. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "CHRONO_WRAITH", "count": 1, "description": "Eliminate. [Chrono Wraith]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "raw_aethel_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect raw aethel fragment (x1). [Item: Raw Aethel Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3450, "currency": 1725, "crd": 834, "rep": 1055, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_058', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 56)
