values ('fq_star_058', 'The Fragmenter Line Must Break', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Soul Fragmenters and a Void Stalker are conducting a coordinated operation along the Chasm''s approach to the Harbinger''s entry point — the same pre-positioning the Harbinger''s other void forces have been executing throughout the Chasm. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, General Kaelen) Grand Justiciar Aurelius''s intelligence analysis is complete: the Harbinger is using the Fragmenters to clear the Chasm''s trapped soul-echoes before its arrival, removing the one resonance frequency that could interfere with its void signature. Break the Fragmenter line. Preserve the interference. Make the Harbinger''s arrival harder.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 58, "reputation_required": 1300, "required_quests": ["fq_star_057"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SOUL_FRAGMENTER", "count": 3, "description": "Break. [Soul Fragmenter]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "VOID_STALKER", "count": 1, "description": "Eliminate. [Void Stalker]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3500, "currency": 1750, "crd": 846, "rep": 1070, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_059', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 57)
