values ('fq_star_060', 'Solidifying the Earth', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE', 'The Severance Faultline is the scar that divides Xylos''s geological substrate along the line of the Great Severance''s shockwave. Grand Justiciar Aurelius approaches the Faultline as a military commander approaches a river crossing: identify the viable ford points, establish bridgehead control, advance through. The other factions approach the Faultline with ideology. The Legion approaches it with maps. Enter the Faultline zone. Establish the first bridgehead. Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 60, "reputation_required": 1400, "required_quests": ["fq_star_059"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE", "count": 1, "description": "Enter. (Travel to: Severance Faultline, Shattered Heart)"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "raw_aethel_fragment", "count": 3, "description": "Collect raw aethel fragment (x3). [Item: Raw Aethel Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3600, "currency": 1800, "crd": 870, "rep": 1100, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_061', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 59)
