values ('fq_star_061', 'Carapace Breach', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE', 'The Aethel Iron Carapace creatures along the Faultline are feeding on the exposed aethel substrate — the same substrate that, according to the Concordium''s geological surveys, represents some of Xylos''s most concentrated raw aethel deposits. (Location: Severance Faultline, General Kaelen) The Legion''s claim to these deposits is straightforward: whoever controls the terrain controls the resources the terrain contains. Clear the Carapace. Secure the substrate. The Faultline''s resources belong to the Legion.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 61, "reputation_required": 1450, "required_quests": ["fq_star_060"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_IRON_CARAPACE", "count": 8, "description": "Breach. [Aethel Iron Carapace]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "crystal_core", "count": 3, "description": "Collect crystal core (x3). [Item: Crystal Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3650, "currency": 1825, "crd": 882, "rep": 1115, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_062', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 60)
