values ('fq_star_062', 'Tyrant Position', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE', 'Crystal Tyrants along the Severance Faultline have positioned themselves at the highest-concentration aethel nodes in the zone — nodes that the Legion''s geological assessors have flagged as critical infrastructure for the Legion''s own energy supply program. Centurion Valka does not respect the Tyrants'' prior claim to these nodes. The Legion arrived. The Legion is stronger. The Tyrants are obstacles. Ground them with the efficiency the Legion code demands. Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 62, "reputation_required": 1500, "required_quests": ["fq_star_061"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CRYSTAL_TYRANT", "count": 2, "description": "Remove. [Crystal Tyrant]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3700, "currency": 1850, "crd": 894, "rep": 1130, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_063', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 61)
