values ('fq_star_063', 'Jotunn Blockade', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE', 'Gigantic Jotunns in the Severance Faultline''s deep access corridors are blocking the Legion''s geological infrastructure teams from reaching the primary aethel substrate. Grand Justiciar Aurelius''s position on geological entities blocking Legion operations has not changed throughout the Xylos campaign: ''Ancient is not exempt. Move them.'' Three Jotunns, three corridors cleared, three days of geological survey work that the Legion''s engineers have been waiting to conduct. The deep stone yields to the Legion. Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 63, "reputation_required": 1550, "required_quests": ["fq_star_062"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GIGANTIC_JOTUNN", "count": 3, "description": "Break. [Gigantic Jotunn]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 1, "description": "Collect monster material (x1). [Item: Monster Material]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3750, "currency": 1875, "crd": 906, "rep": 1145, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_064', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 62)
