values ('fq_star_064', 'Titan Preparation', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE', 'The Faultline''s eastern approach corridor is the last geological obstruction before the Legion''s infrastructure teams can reach the deepest accessible Faultline deposits. (Location: Severance Faultline, General Kaelen) One more Jotunn, one more clearance, one more advance. Grand Justiciar Aurelius briefs this with the same directness he brings to every geological obstacle: ''Move it.'' The materials gathered from the cleared zone will provide the geological interface data the Legion needs for the Aethel Siphon Core approach. Finish this phase.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 64, "reputation_required": 1600, "required_quests": ["fq_star_063"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 3, "description": "Collect core fragment (x3). [Item: Core Fragment]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "GIGANTIC_JOTUNN", "count": 1, "description": "Clear. [Gigantic Jotunn]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3800, "currency": 1900, "crd": 918, "rep": 1160, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_065', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 63)
