values ('fq_star_066', 'Clearing the Siphon''s Approaches', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'AETHEL_SIPHON_CORE', 'Abyssal Reavers have colonized the Aethel Siphon Core''s approach corridors — drawn by the Core''s power output and now constituting the primary obstacle to Legion entry. Centurion Valka''s approach to this obstacle is standard Legion doctrine applied to non-standard terrain: identify all hostiles in the objective zone, establish elimination sequence based on threat level, execute systematically. Twelve Abyssal Reavers, plus Void Channelers. The Siphon''s approaches will be clear before the Legion''s main column enters. Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "AETHEL_SIPHON_CORE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 65, "reputation_required": 1700, "required_quests": ["fq_star_065"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 8, "description": "Purge. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_VOID_CHANNELER", "count": 5, "description": "Purge. [Aethel Void Channeler]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3850, "currency": 1925, "crd": 930, "rep": 1175, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_067', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 65)
