values ('fq_star_068', 'Sealing the Rifts That Drain the Core''s Power', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'AETHEL_SIPHON_CORE', 'Aethel Rift Stalkers have found the Siphon Core''s micro-fractures — exposure points where the Core''s energy bleeds outward — and have been enlarging these fractures through their feeding behavior. (Location: Aethel Siphon Core, General Kaelen) The result: the Core''s output has dropped measurably since the Stalkers'' arrival. The Legion''s engineers need stable Core output for their own energy infrastructure. Clear the Stalkers. Seal the fractures they have widened. The Siphon Core''s power belongs to whatever force controls it, and the Legion controls it now.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "AETHEL_SIPHON_CORE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 67, "reputation_required": 1800, "required_quests": ["fq_star_067"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_RIFT_STALKER", "count": 6, "description": "Patrol. [Aethel Rift Stalker]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "raw_aethel_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect raw aethel fragment (x1). [Item: Raw Aethel Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3950, "currency": 1975, "crd": 954, "rep": 1205, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_069', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 67)
