values ('fq_star_069', 'The Core''s Guardian Names the Legion Worthy', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'AETHEL_SIPHON_CORE', 'Deep in the Aethel Siphon Core, the entity that all other factions'' intelligence has failed to identify correctly — what the Concordium calls an ''anomaly,'' what the Arcanum calls a ''phenomenon,'' what the Children call a ''sacred manifestation'' — waits for the Legion''s advance team. Grand Justiciar Aurelius has reviewed every faction''s engagement record with this entity. None of them passed its trial. ''We will be different,'' he says, without inflection. ''Because we are different.'' Gather what the Core''s approach zones offer. Present the Legion to whatever guards the deepest chamber. Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "AETHEL_SIPHON_CORE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 68, "reputation_required": 1850, "required_quests": ["fq_star_068"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 3, "description": "Collect core fragment (x3). [Item: Core Fragment]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "GIGANTIC_JOTUNN", "count": 1, "description": "Engage. [Gigantic Jotunn]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 4000, "currency": 2000, "crd": 966, "rep": 1220, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_070', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 68)
