values ('fq_star_070', 'The Titan That Rules the Expanse Is Now the Legion''s Target', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'A Gravity Titan in the Cradle Expanse has been disrupting the Legion''s supply lanes with its gravitational field effect — pulling Legion transport vehicles off course and creating navigation hazards that have cost the Legion two weeks of logistical efficiency. Grand Justiciar Aurelius''s assessment is brief: ''Gravity is a terrain feature. This one needs to be removed.'' The Gravity Titan may be the most massive creature on Xylos. The Legion''s soldiers are the most trained on Xylos. The math resolves in the Legion''s favor. Quest giver: General Kaelen at Fortress Kaelen War Room.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 69, "reputation_required": 1900, "required_quests": ["fq_star_069"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GRAVITY_TITAN", "count": 1, "description": "HUMBLE THE TITAN. [Gravity Titan]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 5, "description": "Clear. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 4050, "currency": 2025, "crd": 978, "rep": 1235, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_071', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 69)
