values ('fq_star_074', 'Jotunns at the Forge Must Be Moved', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE', 'Gigantic Jotunns drawn by the Forge''s geological activity have entered the primary processing zone and are creating seismic interference that has halted the Legion''s Prima Materia extraction operations for forty-eight hours. (Location: Prima Materia Forge, General Kaelen) The Legion''s extraction quota is being missed. Grand Justiciar Aurelius does not miss quotas. Three Jotunns, three operational corridors, forty-eight hours of backlogged production waiting to resume. The Forge runs on Legion schedule. Move the Jotunns to the deep stone where they belong.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Centurion Valka", "location": "PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 73, "reputation_required": 2100, "required_quests": ["fq_star_073"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GIGANTIC_JOTUNN", "count": 3, "description": "Conquer. [Gigantic Jotunn]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 1, "description": "Collect monster material (x1). [Item: Monster Material]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 4250, "currency": 2125, "crd": 1026, "rep": 1295, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_075', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 73)
