values ('fq_star_075', 'The Legion Takes What the Forge Produced', 'story', 'S', 'STARFORGED_LEGION', 'PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE', 'Titan Proto-Cores — the Forge''s primary output, concentrations of Prima Materia forged into the construction substrate for the Legion''s most advanced weapons program — have been accumulating in the Forge''s deep storage zone. (Location: Prima Materia Forge, General Kaelen) The Iron Hegemony''s ghost operations are still trying to recover them through remote automated extraction, using the abandoned Hegemony systems the Legion has not yet fully decommissioned. The Proto-Cores belong to the Legion. Clear the automated extraction interference. Take what the Forge has produced under Legion authority.', '{"npc_id": "npc_legion_general", "name": "Grand Justiciar Aurelius", "location": "PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 74, "reputation_required": 2150, "required_quests": ["fq_star_074"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "TITAN_PROTO_CORE", "count": 2, "description": "Recycle. [Titan Proto Core]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "titan_core", "count": 1, "description": "Collect titan core (x1). [Item: Titan Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 4300, "currency": 2150, "crd": 1038, "rep": 1310, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_star_076', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_legion.json', 74)
