values ('fq_merid_003', 'Two Margins in One Shot', 'story', 'D', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'CORAL_WETLANDS', 'The Cartel''s efficiency doctrine: every operation should have at least two revenue streams. (Location: Coral Wetlands, Don Vercelli) Coral Tidal Crabs are blocking the dock access lanes — that''s the cost column. Their shells, however, are worth twelve Aurum Cipher each on the Xylosian artisan market — that''s the profit column. Don Vercelli Mox frames this mission with quiet appreciation: ''The crabs are paying for their own removal.'' This is why the Cartel thinks faster than everyone else.', '{"npc_id": "npc_cartel_boss", "name": "Don Vercelli Mox", "location": "CORAL_WETLANDS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 2, "reputation_required": 10, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_002"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CORAL_TIDAL_CRAB", "count": 5, "desc": "Eliminate Tidal Crabs.", "description": "Defeat Coral Tidal Crab (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "crab_shell", "count": 3, "desc": "Collect shells for export.", "description": "Collect crab shell (x3). [Item: Crab Shell]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 70, "currency": 40, "crd": 0, "rep": 40, "items": [{"item_id": "rust_chitin", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_004', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 2)
