values ('fq_merid_004', 'The Aethel in the Mud', 'story', 'D', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'CORAL_WETLANDS', 'Tide Mudlings have been tunneling through the Cartel''s shipping lane foundations — a nuisance until Don Vercelli Mox''s geological assessors discovered that their mud contains trace aethel deposits from the Severance''s contamination of the tidal substrate. (Location: Coral Wetlands, Don Vercelli) Suddenly the Mudlings are both a problem and a supply source. The Arcanum Seekers would pay handsomely for processed trace aethel. The Cartel''s shipping lanes need clearing. The math, as Vercelli says, ''works out beautifully.''', '{"npc_id": "npc_cartel_boss", "name": "Don Vercelli Mox", "location": "CORAL_WETLANDS"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 3, "reputation_required": 15, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_003"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "TIDE_MUDLING", "count": 5, "desc": "Clear Mudlings from shipping lanes.", "description": "Defeat Tide Mudling (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "mud_core", "count": 3, "desc": "Extract Aethel-infused mud samples.", "description": "Collect mud core (x3). [Item: Mud Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 80, "currency": 50, "crd": 0, "rep": 50, "items": [{"item_id": "slime_gel", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_005', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 3)
