values ('fq_merid_008', 'Written Off', 'story', 'D', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'SMUGGLER_JUNGLE', 'Swamp Rippers — aggressive territorial predators that have been displaced by the jungle''s shrinking clean-water zones, a consequence of the Severance''s long-term pollution — have begun attacking Cartel workers clearing the new trade route. (Location: Smuggler Jungle, Don Vercelli) Don Vercelli Mox has reviewed the incident reports, calculated the injury costs, the lost labor hours, and the equipment damage, and arrived at a figure. ''They''re a liability,'' he says. ''Write them off.'' He means it in every sense.', '{"npc_id": "npc_cartel_boss", "name": "Don Vercelli Mox", "location": "SMUGGLER_JUNGLE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 7, "reputation_required": 30, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_007"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SWAMP_RIPPER", "count": 5, "desc": "Write off Swamp Rippers.", "description": "Defeat Swamp Ripper (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "swamp_scale", "count": 3, "desc": "Collect Ripper hide — still tradable.", "description": "Collect swamp scale (x3). [Item: Swamp Scale]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 180, "currency": 100, "crd": 0, "rep": 100, "items": [{"item_id": "raw_hide", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_009', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 7)
