values ('fq_merid_009', 'Poison as Currency', 'story', 'D', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'SMUGGLER_JUNGLE', 'Madam Z — the Cartel''s black market liaison, a woman who has never been on any official Cartel payroll but whose network Don Vercelli Mox relies on completely — has identified a premium buyer for Jungle Venomfang venom: an alchemical research house operating under Arcanum Seeker patronage. (Location: Smuggler Jungle, Madam Z) Current market rate: four hundred Aurum Cipher per sealed vial. The Venomfangs also happen to be harassing the new trade route. In the Cartel, the best problems solve two things at once.', '{"npc_id": "npc_black_market_dealer", "name": "Don Vercelli Mox", "location": "SMUGGLER_JUNGLE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 8, "reputation_required": 35, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_008"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "JUNGLE_VENOMFANG", "count": 5, "desc": "Harvest Venomfang venom assets.", "description": "Defeat Jungle Venomfang (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "venom_sac", "count": 3, "desc": "Secure venom vials for market.", "description": "Collect venom sac (x3). [Item: Venom Sac]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 200, "currency": 110, "crd": 0, "rep": 110, "items": [{"item_id": "venom_sac", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_010', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 8)
