values ('fq_merid_010', 'Hostile Inventory', 'story', 'D', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'SMUGGLER_JUNGLE', 'A Contraband Golem — a war construct that a previous black-market operation used as a walking vault, stuffed with illegal goods before the operation was shut down by whoever they were dealing with — now blocks the main Cartel trade route, attacking anyone who approaches. (Location: Smuggler Jungle, Don Vercelli) Don Vercelli Mox does not ask what is inside it. He already knows, because the original operator owed the Cartel a very large sum. ''Consider this a repossession,'' he says, adjusting his cufflinks.', '{"npc_id": "npc_cartel_boss", "name": "Don Vercelli Mox", "location": "SMUGGLER_JUNGLE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 9, "reputation_required": 40, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_009"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CONTRABAND_GOLEM", "count": 2, "desc": "Liquidate Contraband Golems.", "description": "Defeat Contraband Golem (x2)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "contraband_core", "count": 1, "desc": "Seize the Golem''s inventory manifest.", "description": "Collect contraband core (x1). [Item: Contraband Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 300, "currency": 180, "crd": 0, "rep": 180, "items": [{"item_id": "scrap_circuit", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_011', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 9)
