values ('fq_merid_016', 'Market Share, By Force', 'story', 'C', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'BLACK_DOCK_MARKET', 'The remaining Enforcer crews in the Black Dock''s western sector are coordinating their resistance — sharing intelligence, covering each other''s operations, and actively steering clients away from Cartel-licensed services. (Location: Black Dock Market, Don Vercelli) Don Vercelli Mox calls this ''a price war conducted with weapons.'' He finds it almost impressive. Almost. The Cartel''s market share in the Black Dock will be total, or these Enforcer crews will serve as a case study in what happens when you compete with the Cartel.', '{"npc_id": "npc_cartel_boss", "name": "Don Vercelli Mox", "location": "BLACK_DOCK_MARKET"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 15, "reputation_required": 70, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_015"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "BLACK_DOCK_ENFORCER", "count": 4, "desc": "Break Enforcer resistance.", "description": "Defeat Black Dock Enforcer (x4)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "contraband_core", "count": 1, "desc": "Report expanded market share.", "description": "Collect contraband core (x1). [Item: Contraband Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 520, "currency": 290, "crd": 0, "rep": 310, "items": [{"item_id": "scrap_metal", "quantity": 4}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_017', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 15)
