values ('fq_merid_017', 'The Missing Line Items', 'story', 'C', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'BLACK_DOCK_MARKET', 'Sly''s ledger has discrepancies — four shipments of Cartel-controlled goods that were logged entering the Black Dock but never logged arriving at their designated berths. (Location: Black Dock Market, Sly) Someone in the distribution chain is skimming, and in the Cartel''s contract framework, inventory theft carries a very specific clause. Find the missing goods. Find the people who took them. The goods come back to the Cartel. The people do not.', '{"npc_id": "npc_shady_smuggler", "name": "Don Vercelli Mox", "location": "BLACK_DOCK_MARKET"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 16, "reputation_required": 75, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_016"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "collect", "target": "contraband_core", "count": 4, "desc": "Recover missing inventory shipments.", "description": "Collect contraband core (x4). [Item: Contraband Core]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "BLACK_DOCK_SMUGGLER", "count": 3, "desc": "Deal with inventory thieves.", "description": "Defeat Black Dock Smuggler (x3)."}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 480, "currency": 260, "crd": 0, "rep": 260, "items": [{"item_id": "con_nutrient_ration", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_018', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 16)
