values ('fq_merid_018', 'There Is Only One Cartel', 'story', 'C', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'BLACK_DOCK_MARKET', 'A coordinated Enforcer syndicate — eight cells, unified leadership, financed from outside the Cartel network — has positioned itself as a ''competitive alternative'' to Meridian operations in the Black Dock. (Location: Black Dock Market, Don Vercelli) Don Vercelli Mox reads the intelligence with the expression of someone who has been mildly inconvenienced. ''There is only one Cartel,'' he says. ''Everything else is a temporary arrangement.'' Break the syndicate at its leadership. The alternative to the Cartel does not get to exist.', '{"npc_id": "npc_cartel_boss", "name": "Don Vercelli Mox", "location": "BLACK_DOCK_MARKET"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 17, "reputation_required": 80, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_017"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "BLACK_DOCK_ENFORCER", "count": 5, "desc": "Break the rival Enforcer cartel.", "description": "Defeat Black Dock Enforcer (x5)."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "contraband_core", "count": 1, "desc": "Seize their operations ledger.", "description": "Collect contraband core (x1). [Item: Contraband Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 600, "currency": 330, "crd": 0, "rep": 350, "items": [{"item_id": "tactical_sensor_cluster", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_019', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 17)
