values ('fq_merid_019', 'Closing a Disruptive Account', 'story', 'C', 'MERIDIAN_CARTEL', 'BLACK_DOCK_MARKET', 'A Resonance Echo has formed in the Black Dock''s deep storage sector — drawn by the high concentration of aethel goods the Cartel has been routing through here. (Location: Black Dock Market, Don Vercelli) Its harmonic interference is scrambling encrypted Cartel communications, which means every deal in progress is potentially compromised. Don Vercelli Mox describes this in precise financial terms: an entity generating unlimited liability with zero revenue contribution. In the Cartel''s accounting framework, such accounts are closed permanently.', '{"npc_id": "npc_cartel_boss", "name": "Don Vercelli Mox", "location": "BLACK_DOCK_MARKET"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 18, "reputation_required": 85, "required_quests": ["fq_merid_018"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "RESONANCE_ECHO", "count": 1, "desc": "Close the Resonance Echo''s account.", "description": "Defeat Resonance Echo (x1)."}, {"type": "kill", "target": "BLACK_DOCK_ENFORCER", "count": 2, "desc": "Liquidate Enforcer escorts.", "description": "Defeat Black Dock Enforcer (x2)."}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 800, "currency": 450, "crd": 0, "rep": 450, "items": [{"item_id": "entropy_core", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_merid_020', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_meridian.json', 18)
